  "",
  "\`\`\`txt",
  "xrf-cli externs export [OPTIONS] --dest <dest> <path>",
  "\`\`\`",
  "",
  "| Option | Required | Default | Description |",
  "| ------ | -------- | ------- | ----------- |",
