  "xrf-cli omf filter-motions [OPTIONS] --dest <dest> <--keep <keep>|--keep-prefix <keep-prefix>> <path>",
  "\`\`\`",
  "",
  "| Option | Required | Default | Description |",
  "| ------ | -------- | ------- | ----------- |",
  "| \`<path>\` | yes |  | Path to omf file |",
  "| \`-d, --dest <dest>\` | yes |  | Path to resulting omf file |",
